29 CFR 1910.178(l)
[29 CFR 1910.178(l)(3)(i)(D)] (D) Engine or motor operation;
[29 CFR 1910.178(l)(3)(i)(E)] (E) Steering and maneuvering;
[29 CFR 1910.178(l)(3)(i)(F)] (F) Visibility (including restrictions due to loading);
[29 CFR 1910.178(l)(3)(i)(G)] (G) Fork and attachment adaptation, operation, and use limitations;
[29 CFR 1910.178(l)(3)(i)(H)] (H) Vehicle capacity;
[29 CFR 1910.178(l)(3)(i)(I)] (I) Vehicle stability;
[29 CFR 1910.178(l)(3)(i)(J)] (J) Any vehicle inspection and maintenance that the operator will be required to perform;
[29 CFR 1910.178(l)(3)(i)(K)] (K) Refueling and/or charging and recharging of batteries;
[29 CFR 1910.178(l)(3)(i)(L)] (L) Operating limitations;
[29 CFR 1910.178(l)(3)(i)(M)] (M) Any other operating instructions, warnings, or precautions listed in the operator's manual for the types of vehicle that the employee is being trained to operate.
